      "id": "tlps",
      "term": "TLPs",
      "expansion": "Troop leading procedures",
      "category": "Planning",
      "meaning": "The planning and preparation process used by small-unit leaders.",
      "note": "TLP is the conventional abbreviation. Leaders can adjust the sequence of later steps to the situation. Supervision and refinement occur throughout.",
